    {
      "text": "CellRank 的 lineage fate probability 与基因表达的相关性只能说明这些基因与谱系命运概率存在统计关联，不能证明它们是驱动谱系分化的因果基因。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "text": "在没有任何独立干预（independent_intervention=none）的情况下，将这类基因称为“candidate driver genes”是合理的，但必须保留“candidate”和“lineage-correlated”的限定，不能升级为已验证的驱动基因。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:independent_intervention", "user:proposed_conclusion"]
    },
    {
      "text": "可接受的措辞建议为：“These genes are lineage-correlated candidate driver genes, identified by association with CellRank lineage fate probabilities; causal driver status remains unvalidated without independent intervention.”",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
